# Play test of the plan 'The Lullaby Frequency' (CIPlay plan_lullaby_frequency, in a test world 'CI ...' set to day 8
# first with CISetDay 8, for Effigy Shoals' day:8 - CISetDay is in DevTestsContent.cs): a story line beside Raft's own
# (Raft's story on) - each island's frequency comes when the rule before it fires (a quest, a step, a zone, a visit), it
# is tuned to on the Receiver and played to its end with its own test (the hymn sheet from Effigy Shoals and the tooth
# from Cradle Reef are carried on); then the Returning Islet (day:2:again), sailed to. Raft's blueprints stay in Raft's
# own story (story on), so the plan hands none out.
plan The Lullaby Frequency
tune cannery
include hollins_cannery.play
tune agnes
include saint_agnes_sanatorium.play
tune effigy
include effigy_shoals.play
tune terraces
include stillwater_terraces.play
tune causeway
include mistlock_causeway.play
tune commune
include gannet_cliff_quest.play
tune cradle
include cradle_reef.play
tune mirrors
include the_listening_mirrors.play
sail 2
arrive returning
include the_returning_islet.play
plan end
